# Devlog – March 8, 2026

## Overview
This devlog summarizes the first two weeks of development on State of Dissent.

---

## Week One
- Implemented player camera and walking controls. 
- Implemented player sprint.
- Implemented player interaction with couch and work terminal. 
- Laid assets for the first two blocks: residential and commercial plaza block.
- Created the railroad blockout to outline the limits of the town.
- Implemented the day and time cycle.
- Implemented loop for interacting with couch and sleeping

## Week Two
- Implemented the Money system.
- Implemented loop for working, earning, money. 
- Added text pop up for showing up to work too early. 
- Added text pop up for only being able to work once per day. 
- Implemented Stress, Morale, and Stamina meters
- Implemented loop for work and sleep stress and morale patterns. 
- Added two more block finishing the initial layout for the Union District.
- Updated minor UI adjustments

## Systems Implemented

### Time and Day Cycle
Implemented a clock system that tracks the current time and day of the week.

### Work System
Players can interact with a terminal to complete a work shift and earn money.  
Pay varies depending on the time the player arrives.

### Stress and Morale
Added a stress system that increases from sprinting and working.  
High stress lowers morale while low stress allows morale to recover.

### Stamina
Implemented sprint stamina. When stamina reaches zero the player is forced to walk.

